   "id": 615474,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The  widening of transportation and communication networks as a result of the market revolution benefited Harriet Beecher Stowe’s cause in writing <i>Uncle Tom’s Cabin</i> because ",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1169868,
     "content_html": "the more books she sold, the wealthier she became\n"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169869,
     "content_html": "it helped the book become widely read, increasing abolitionist sentiment \n"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169867,
     "content_html": "she was able to travel extensively in Great Britain\n"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169866,
     "content_html": "it created a mass market for book-related merchandise\n"
    }
   ],
